  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "The value of \\(\\left(\\dfrac1{16}\\right)^{a^0}+\\left(\\dfrac1{16a}\\right)^0\\) \\({}-64^{-\\frac{1}{2}}-(-32)^{-\\frac{4}{5}}\\) is:",
